id: 9
hanzi: 暗下决心
pinyin: àn xià jué xīn
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Idiom

meanings_summary:
  en: to make up one's mind secretly; to resolve firmly in private
  es: tomar una determinación en secreto; resolver firmemente en privado

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Idiom | Standard | to form a resolute, silent inward commitment without declaring it outwardly | tomar una decisión firme y callada en el interior de uno mismo | 暗下决心改变现状 (secretly resolve to change the situation)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 看到父母日渐苍老的面容和简陋的土屋，他在心底暗下决心，一定要通过自己的勤劳改变家庭的命运。 | Kàndào fùmǔ rìjiàn cānglǎo de miànróng hé jiǎnlòu de tǔwū, tā zài xīndǐ ànxià juéxīn, yídìng yào tōngguò zìjǐ de qínláo gǎibiàn jiātíng de mìngyùn. | Seeing his parents' aging faces and their humble earthen hut, he secretly resolved in his heart to change their family's destiny through diligent labor. | Al contemplar los rostros envejecidos de sus padres y la humilde choza, decidió en su interior con firmeza que cambiaría el destino familiar mediante el trabajo arduo.
  #2 | 经历了初创时期的重重阻碍与挫折，团队负责人暗下决心，无论面对多大压力都要坚持完成核心技术攻关。 | Jīnglì le chūchuàng shíqī de zhòngzhòng zǔ'ài yǔ cuòzhé, tuánduì fùzérén ànxià juéxīn, wúlùn miànduì duō dà yālì dōuyào jiānchí wánchéng héxīn jìshù gōngguān. | Having endured setbacks in the startup phase, the project director secretly resolved to conquer core technical hurdles no matter how great the pressure. | Tras superar tropiezos durante los inicios del proyecto, el director tomó la firme resolución interna de persistir hasta dominar las tecnologías clave frente a cualquier obstáculo.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  暗下决心发愤图强 | secretly resolve to work hard with determination
  在心底暗下决心 | make up one's mind secretly in one's heart
  暗下决心努力学习 | secretly resolve to study hard
  暗下决心改变现状 | secretly resolve to change the status quo
  暗下决心不负期望 | privately resolve not to disappoint expectations
  暗下决心追赶差距 | secretly resolve to close the gap

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  下定决心 | xià dìng jué xīn | make a firm resolution
  立志图强 | lì zhì tú qiáng | resolve to strive for strength and success
  咬紧牙关 | yǎo jǐn yá guān | grit one's teeth and bear through hardship
  矢志不渝 | shǐ zhì bù yú | firmly committed and unwavering in one's resolve

character_decomposition[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  暗 | àn | dark; secret; concealed | oscuro; secreto; oculto | 日 | sun | 日 (sun hidden / eclipsed) | 音 (yīn / sound phonetic) | 13 | 左右结构 | Phono-semantic compound: 日 (sun obscure/absent) + 音 (sound), depicting darkness, concealment, or unspoken private thoughts. | The sun (日) eclipsed, cloaking thoughts in secret soundless quietude (音). | El sol (日) oculto bajo la sombra, guardando reflexiones en discreto silencio (音). | 51 | AYA | ""
  下 | xià | down; lower; execute | abajo; descender; fijar | 一 | one | 一 (ground line) | 卜 (indicator pointing below the line) | 3 | 单一结构 | Indicative character: an indicator mark beneath a base horizontal boundary line, signifying downward motion or fixing. | A mark positioned firmly downward under a baseline line. | Una marca que señala hacia abajo bajo una línea base, indicando firmeza. | 51 | MY | ""
  决 | jué | decide; resolve; breach | decidir; resolver | 冫 | ice / two drops water | 冫 (water bursting/ice) | 夬 (guài / notch/bursting breach) | 6 | 左右结构 | Phono-semantic compound: 冫/氵 (surging flow) + 夬 (cleaving through an obstacle), representing decisive breakthrough. | Cutting decisively through frozen obstacles like water breaching a dam. | Romper con firmeza diques u obstáculos como el agua que fluye incontenible. | 35 | EDK | 決
  心 | xīn | heart; mind; intention | corazón; mente; voluntad | 心 | heart | 心 (pictograph of human heart with valves) | "" | 4 | 单一结构 | Pictographic depiction of the anatomical human heart, the metaphorical seat of consciousness and resolve. | The beating heart chamber holding one's deepest vows and spirit. | La cámara del corazón que custodia los votos y anhelos más profundos. | 55 | P | ""

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: In the private darkness of the mind (暗), planting downward (下) a decisive breach (决) of will across the heart (心) means making up one's mind secretly (暗下决心).
  composite_memory_hook_es: En la íntima penumbra del alma (暗), sembrar hacia adentro (下) una firme decisión (决) en el corazón (心) significa jurarse algo en secreto (暗下决心).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Chinese narrative tradition valorizes quiet, resolute inner oaths over empty verbal boasting. An oath sworn silently to oneself indicates deep maturity and indomitable endurance.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Falling-falling-rising-high: àn xià jué xīn (51-51-35-55). Note that '决' rises cleanly on tone 2, followed by steady tone 1 on 'xīn'.

traps_and_cognates:
