    明 | míng | bright; clear | Has 月 (moon) beside 日 instead of 音 (sound)
    快 | kuài | fast; quick | Has 忄 (heart) with 夬 instead of 冫
    块 | kuài | piece; lump | Has 土 (earth) with 夬 instead of 冫
    必 | bì | must; necessarily | Has a diagonal slash cutting through 心
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
