    决定 | jué dìng | decide; decision
    心里 | xīn lǐ | in one's heart / mind

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 暗下决心 highlights an internal, private psychological commitment forged without external declaration.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 暗下决心 vs. 下定决心 | xiàdìng juéxīn | 暗下决心 emphasizes that the resolution is formed silently in private without letting others know, whereas 下定决心 simply denotes forming a firm resolution, which can be announced publicly.
    2 | 暗下决心 vs. 拿定主意 | nádìng zhǔyi | 暗下决心 carries intense emotional resolve, long-term moral weight, and determination, whereas 拿定主意 usually refers to making a practical choice or settling on a specific plan of action.
    3 | 暗下决心 vs. 立下誓言 | lìxià shìyán | 暗下决心 is an unspoken mental vow, whereas 立下誓言 involves swearing an explicit verbal oath, often before witnesses.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 目睹年迈双亲在饥寒交迫中艰难支撑，年轻的子路在心底暗下决心：哪怕翻山越岭、历尽千难万险，也一定要去百里之外打工背米，让父母不再挨饿受冻。 | Mùdǔ niánmài shuāngqīn zài jīhán-jiāopò zhōng jiānnán zhīchēng, niánqīng de Zǐlù zài xīndǐ ànxià juéxīn: nǎpà fānshān-yuèlǐng, lìjìn qiānnán-wànxiǎn, yě yídìng yào qù bǎilǐ zhī wài dǎgōng bēimǐ, ràng fùmǔ búzài ái'è shòudòng. | Seeing his elderly parents struggle amid hunger and freezing cold, young Zilu secretly resolved in his heart: even if crossing steep mountains and enduring countless trials, he would journey far away to earn and carry rice for them. | Al ver a sus ancianos progenitores pasar hambre y frío, el joven Zilu decidió en secreto que, aunque debiera escalar montañas y sortear mil peligros, viajaría lejos a trabajar para llevarles arroz y aliviar sus penas.
  #2 | 在许多励志人物的成长历程中，改变人生命运的关键契机往往不是轰轰烈烈的宣言，而是一个人在困境中暗下决心的沉静时刻。那种发自内心深处的自我期许与坚毅信念，能够在漫长的岁月里转化为源源不断的前进动力。 | Zài xǔduō lìzhì rénwù de chéngzhǎng lìchéng zhōng, gǎibiàn rénshēng mìngyùn de guānjiàn qìjī wǎngwǎng bú shì hōnghōnglièliè de xuānyán, ér shì yí gè rén zài kùnjìng zhōng ànxià juéxīn de chénjìng shíkè. Nà zhǒng fā zì nèixīn shēnchù de zìwǒ qīxǔ yǔ jiānyì xìnniàn, nénggòu zài màncháng de suìyuè lǐ zhuǎnhuà wéi yuányuán-bùduàn de qiánjìn dònglì. | In the journeys of inspiring figures, life-altering turning points are rarely loud declarations, but quiet moments when one secretly makes up one's mind in adversity. That deep internal conviction transforms into enduring motivation. | En la vida de quienes triunfan frente a la adversidad, el punto de inflexión no suele ser una proclama ruidosa, sino el instante íntimo en que se proponen superarse. Esa determinación callada se convierte con el tiempo en una fuerza imparable.
